@baseUrl = http://localhost:5188

### Health check (S2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Master test-data reset (Development / Test only).
### Set the X-Test-Data-Key header to the value of the env var named in TestData:KeyEnvVar.
### The value itself is never stored in this repository.
POST {{baseUrl}}/TestData/Reset/master
X-Test-Data-Key: <E2E_TEST_DATA_KEY>
